    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/f10e70c1f3a40a99c35d3396b935e3d7.avif?t=1691703647\" /></span><br><br>Embark on an epic journey that weaves together the threads of different game modes, painting a tapestry of adventure and danger. Immerse yourself in the heart-pounding campaign, where each step forward uncovers new mysteries and pushes your limits to the edge.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/c8d884226d4a9ec9250642f1bdafa6b1.poster.avif?t=1691703647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/c8d884226d4a9ec9250642f1bdafa6b1.webm?t=1691703647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/c8d884226d4a9ec9250642f1bdafa6b1.mp4?t=1691703647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/294e25e9d2811099f82f17d080c21446.avif?t=1691703647\" /></span><br><br>Select your hero and strive to achieve glory: an array of distinct, an impressive assortment of exceptional and powerful heroes eagerly awaits your decision. Take on the mantle of these mighty champions and let your skills and strategy shine through <i>Blazing Dragon,</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/ba9da69ef085aa00ec52224b4c9b0d32.poster.avif?t=1691703647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/ba9da69ef085aa00ec52224b4c9b0d32.webm?t=1691703647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/ba9da69ef085aa00ec52224b4c9b0d32.mp4?t=1691703647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/333fefcdbc2731a0c3260c4ef1e2e02d.avif?t=1691703647\" /></span><br><br>Experience the charm of roguelite spices that unveil delightful surprises: every attempt tempts with alluring new rewards. Explore the stunning environments, adorned with captivating art and a mesmerizing soundtrack, ensuring an enchanting journey through this captivating realm.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/756b5e50cc249820c47341116254a06b.poster.avif?t=1691703647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/756b5e50cc249820c47341116254a06b.webm?t=1691703647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/756b5e50cc249820c47341116254a06b.mp4?t=1691703647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/9fb16812143fc0ff2759d1dd555628c6.avif?t=1691703647\" /></span><br><br>In the Inn's depths, a dedicated blacksmith hammers at the forge. Browse gleaming weapons, armor, and enchanted trinkets. Invest resources to upgrade, empowering yourself to face perils ahead with strength and resilience.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493580/extras/15be15f881588e95e0dd61c804b41b2e.avif?t=1691703647\" /></span><br><br><i>Now available on PC,<br>A Blazing Dragon awaits to thee, <br>For honor and glory, it must be!</i>",
